# `go build ./...` in this directory writes the binary here, next to the
# source. The repo's identifier gate holds a "no binaries in this tree"
# invariant (see the root .gitignore's voice-wake note), and a 23 MB artifact
# that is rebuilt on every run is exactly what that rule is for: the image is
# built from the Dockerfile, so a committed copy could only ever be a second,
# stale answer to "what is running".
/instagram-bridge
